# strings2 — counters with INCR / INCRBY
#
# Learn: INCR, INCRBY and DECRBY treat a string as a 64-bit integer and
# change it atomically on the server. Reading the value, adding in your
# app and writing it back loses updates as soon as two clients race.
#
# Task: page:home:views already holds some number (the check seeds it).
# Record one more visit, then a batch of 5 more visits imported from a
# log. Don't assume what the current value is: the check runs your file
# against more than one starting value.
#

GET page:home:views
SET page:home:views 11
SET page:home:views 16
